feat: v0.2.0 - Benchmark Arena, Time Machine Rollback, Smart Indexer, Headless Browser

- Benchmark Arena UI with leaderboard, tier filters, live progress
- In-app tab switcher Chat <-> Arena in Sidebar
- Session Diff Time Machine: file_snapshots table captures before/after on every write/edit
- Rollback UI: Rollback files and chat to here action on assistant messages
- Inline Revert file change button in ToolBlock for write_file/edit_file calls
- Smart Project Indexer: fast-glob AST scanner caches .flashgent/index.json
- Injects project outline into system prompt
- Headless Browser Tool: Electron offscreen browse_page tool with screenshot support
- Multi-model routing: single model default, VRAM-aware no dual-load
- DB migration v4: benchmark_runs and file_snapshots tables
- New IPC channels: benchmarkList/Delete, fsSnapshotList/Revert, fsRollbackTurn, browserBrowse, indexerScan/Get
- New unit test: snapshots-rollback.test.ts
- Bump version to 0.2.0
